WEBVTT

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.900
Sunshine Dynamite!

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:18.640
So long has time flown, and with it countless Precure have risen to stand in my way.

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.470
But today's shall be the last.

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:30.030
The Flowers of all Hearts have withered,

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:32.550
and the Great Heart Tree has all but perished.

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:38.260
The Earth belongs to I, Dune!

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:48.830
<i>Tsubomi...</i>

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:51.150
Tsubomi!

00:00:51.740 --> 00:00:52.870
Grandma?

00:00:53.880 --> 00:00:54.890
Grandma?!

00:00:54.890 --> 00:00:55.990
Huh?

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:57.760
What's the matter?

00:00:57.760 --> 00:00:59.700
Did you have a nightmare or something?

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:02.000
Don't worry yourself.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:04.570
Seeing your face made me forget what it was about.

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:13.800
To think, my little Tsubomi's grown this big.

00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:21.950
{OP}

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:25.180
HeartCatch

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:26.640
Precure!

00:01:27.810 --> 00:01:30.190
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:33.190
Now, all together

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:35.700
HeartCatch Precure!

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:38.700
Let's make our flowers bloom

00:01:43.750 --> 00:01:46.290
Within each of our chests,

00:01:46.450 --> 00:01:48.950
they begin to sprout

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:50.630
The seeds of the heart

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:51.870
are growing

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:54.500
bit by bit

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:55.180
Red,

00:01:55.170 --> 00:01:55.790
white

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:57.100
and yellow

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:59.840
It's because these blooming buds are

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:01.300
all varied colors

00:02:01.630 --> 00:02:02.770
that they

00:02:02.840 --> 00:02:04.930
shine so brightly!

00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:10.270
That smile that you've nurtured

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:12.770
with such care

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:15.480
will never wither

00:02:16.650 --> 00:02:19.070
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:21.940
Now, all together

00:02:21.940 --> 00:02:24.420
HeartCatch Precure!

00:02:24.570 --> 00:02:27.070
Let's make our flowers bloom!

00:02:27.490 --> 00:02:32.010
They're always right by our sides

00:02:32.010 --> 00:02:32.840
So together

00:02:32.840 --> 00:02:36.670
let's make those pretty flowers of our heart

00:02:36.720 --> 00:02:39.640
bloom even more!

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:41.140
HeartCatch

00:02:41.140 --> 00:02:42.640
Precure!

00:02:52.770 --> 00:02:55.230
Ah, Lord Coupe...

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:56.550
Lord Coupe...

00:02:56.550 --> 00:02:57.690
Lord Coupe...

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:02.610
What's the matter, dears? 
You all seem rather exhausted.

00:03:02.610 --> 00:03:04.130
We are!

00:03:04.130 --> 00:03:07.750
The thing is, when we fought that new Desertrian the other day...

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:12.960
We did kinda win, but things were looking bad for a second there.

00:03:13.300 --> 00:03:15.500
After that, we kind of talked things over,

00:03:15.830 --> 00:03:18.410
and we realized we had to get stronger too.

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:25.930
And then I remembered that I'd heard about you getting this amazing power before, Cure Flower!

00:03:25.930 --> 00:03:30.640
That you had this amazing object that'd raise 
someone's strength and potential to infinite levels!

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:33.740
If you had shomething that good, you should've told us earlier!

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:35.650
So, where is it?!

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:39.810
It's still far too soon for you to use it.

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:43.280
The HeartCatch Mirage.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:50.830
A Showdown With the Hottie?

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:50.830
A Showdown With the Hottie?

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:53.290
The HeartCatch Mirage...

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:58.210
It's a most mysterious item that grants a Precure infinite power.

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:09.520
Fifty years ago, I confronted Dune, the Desert King, as Cure Flower.

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:22.360
With the last of my power,
 I used the HeartCatch Mirage.

00:04:23.510 --> 00:04:26.180
Somehow I managed to hold Dune to a stalemate,

00:04:26.920 --> 00:04:29.380
but because I exceeded the limit of my powers,

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:32.210
I lost the ability to become Cure Flower.

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:39.550
I want to help you all grow, but only at your own pace.

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:41.480
Please, just forget about it.

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:46.000
That's not like you at all, Grandma!

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:46.930
Huh?

00:04:47.360 --> 00:04:50.040
"If you give up without even trying, it's all over."

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:52.810
You always said that to encourage me!

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:57.660
I don't mean to sound out of line,

00:04:57.660 --> 00:04:59.900
but we're really serious about this!

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:05.150
If we do fall in battle to a Desertrian, then we won't be able to protect everyone's hearts.

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:07.180
We'll take on any challenge!

00:05:07.180 --> 00:05:09.780
We won't learn anything if we don't even try, right?!

00:05:11.900 --> 00:05:13.000
Grandma,

00:05:13.380 --> 00:05:16.830
how can we find the HeartCatch Mirage?

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:20.840
It's in the Precure Palace.

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:23.300
Once she lost her powers,

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:28.340
Cure Flower placed the HeartCatch Mirage in the Precures' castle, the Precure Palace.

00:05:28.710 --> 00:05:31.310
Is that not correct, Kaoruko?

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:33.220
The Precure Palace?

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:34.730
Yuri...

00:05:35.220 --> 00:05:37.840
The Desert Apostles grow ever stronger.

00:05:37.840 --> 00:05:42.150
I think it would be best if they at least had 
the HeartCatch Mirage in their possession.

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:45.900
The Precure Palace?! So we just need to go there, right?!

00:05:45.900 --> 00:05:47.150
Where is it, exactly?

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:49.940
You can't just walk in and take it!

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:51.830
An arduous trial awaits you.

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:54.800
We're ready to take on whatever trial we have to!

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:56.340
Bring it on!

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:03.170
Grandma, I'm not your little Tsubomi anymore.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:12.870
I understand.

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:15.600
I'll take you to the Precure Palace.

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:30.700
There was a place like this here in the botanical gardens?!

00:06:31.660 --> 00:06:34.020
Yuri, won't you come with us?

00:06:34.020 --> 00:06:34.790
What?

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:38.330
I'd like you to be there to watch us, Yuri.

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.480
Potpourri.

00:06:41.480 --> 00:06:42.100
Yesh?

00:06:42.100 --> 00:06:44.210
You have a Seed with you, right?

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:46.760
You mean thish?

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:50.350
That's the key that'll open the door to the Precure Palace.

00:06:51.380 --> 00:06:53.460
Place the Seed in that opening.

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:55.350
Shure!

00:07:14.010 --> 00:07:15.200
See you later.

00:07:24.530 --> 00:07:28.330
The Desert King Dune's castle draws ever closer.

00:07:34.040 --> 00:07:35.550
Fifty years ago...

00:07:36.480 --> 00:07:41.350
It's because I didn't defeat the 
Desert King that they must fight.

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:56.780
Where are we?

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:04.040
Look!

00:08:15.310 --> 00:08:17.400
That is the Precure Palace.

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:18.890
Now, prepare yourselves!

00:08:19.240 --> 00:08:20.310
Right!

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:31.990
Seeds of the Precure, go forth!

00:08:35.300 --> 00:08:36.680
Precure!

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:38.240
Open My Heart!

00:09:24.720 --> 00:09:27.910
A lone flower, blooming from the earth!

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:33.030
Cure Blossom!

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:38.570
A lone flower, swaying in the sea breeze!

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.160
Cure Marine!

00:09:45.760 --> 00:09:48.690
A lone flower, bathing in the Sun's rays!

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:52.610
Cure Sunshine!

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:59.480
HeartCatch Precure!

00:10:01.710 --> 00:10:05.290
Right then, let's go hunt some treasure!

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:07.460
Eek!

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:09.290
W-We're way too high up!

00:10:09.290 --> 00:10:12.520
Don't look down! If you don't look then it's not scary!

00:10:12.520 --> 00:10:15.000
Just relax. We're here with you.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:15.760
Okay.

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:33.440
It's just like before.

00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:39.410
The Great Heart Tree has come to watch over the HeartCatch Mirage's trial.

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:46.250
Dark Precure!

00:10:58.420 --> 00:11:02.050
I was defeated by Dark Precure.

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:04.640
Before I could even undertake my trial.

00:11:07.090 --> 00:11:08.110
Let's go.

00:11:29.880 --> 00:11:30.850
Potpourri?

00:11:31.770 --> 00:11:33.040
Wait for me, pleashe!

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:38.510
Incredible.

00:11:38.980 --> 00:11:39.920
What is this place?

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:44.800
Someone's there!

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:51.440
Huh?! Grandma?!

00:11:51.800 --> 00:11:55.760
I am Cure Flower, Precure of a bygone age.

00:11:55.760 --> 00:12:00.400
In accordance with the ancient laws,
 I guard the legendary HeartCatch Mirage.

00:12:01.120 --> 00:12:04.320
Have you the heart and strength to obtain it?

00:12:04.320 --> 00:12:06.450
I shall be your judge!

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:10.200
Now step forth and show you are capable of defeating me!

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:35.310
The HeartCatch Mirage is a mysterious item that boasts great power.

00:12:35.780 --> 00:12:38.770
If you are to receive it, you must bear a strong heart.

00:12:39.380 --> 00:12:41.790
Now, show me your strong hearts!

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:42.940
Is this...

00:12:42.940 --> 00:12:45.490
Defeating the previous generation's Precure.

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:50.220
That is the trial one must undergo to obtain the HeartCatch Mirage.

00:12:55.280 --> 00:13:00.130
Long ago, I came here and 
defeated the Precure before me,

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:02.880
and obtained the HeartCatch Mirage.

00:13:02.880 --> 00:13:04.020
No way.

00:13:04.020 --> 00:13:07.720
I can't fight you, Grandma!

00:13:08.200 --> 00:13:11.850
Even if it is your trial, I can't fight you either, Tsubomi.

00:13:13.380 --> 00:13:15.580
So he shall fight in my place!

00:13:23.070 --> 00:13:24.780
You're...

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:29.470
Why are you...

00:13:29.470 --> 00:13:32.500
Hey! It's that mysterious hunk!

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:34.540
Who's he?

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:37.790
He looks just like your grandma's husband.

00:13:37.790 --> 00:13:40.630
He's this guy who always saves us when we're in trouble!

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:42.230
Why's he here?

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:48.390
Your fight against the Desert
 Apostles will grow ever tougher.

00:13:48.750 --> 00:13:51.590
You need to have the resolve to 
persevere, no matter what befalls you.

00:13:52.380 --> 00:13:55.810
If you lack that resolve, you
 should abandon being Precures!

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:02.190
I've always had a bit of a secret crush on you,

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:03.150
but...

00:14:03.550 --> 00:14:07.330
there are things that we have to protect!

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:10.870
If defeating you is the trial we have to overcome,

00:14:10.870 --> 00:14:15.830
th-then I will surpass you!

00:14:17.620 --> 00:14:20.290
Yuri, take the fairies and get back!

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:22.040
All right!

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:25.350
Now, show me!

00:14:25.350 --> 00:14:28.180
Show me the strength of your hearts!

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:39.480
Blossom Shower!

00:14:40.380 --> 00:14:43.440
Marine Shoot!

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:50.780
Blossom! Marine!

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:56.540
Sunflower Aegis!

00:14:58.530 --> 00:15:00.620
She's good at protecting her front,

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:01.630
but not her sides!

00:15:10.600 --> 00:15:13.100
You're all still far too inexperienced.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:17.060
I knew it was too early for you to undergo this trial.

00:15:17.410 --> 00:15:19.140
You can do it!

00:15:19.140 --> 00:15:21.420
Blossom, fight!

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:23.290
Marine, show some guts!

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:25.320
Sunshine, don't loshe!

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:26.740
Give it everything you've got!

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:27.880
You can do it!

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:28.780
Give it your all!

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:30.600
We <i>are</i> giving it our all!

00:15:30.600 --> 00:15:33.930
They've kinda brightened me up a bit, though.

00:15:33.930 --> 00:15:34.740
Yeah, guess so!

00:15:36.100 --> 00:15:38.860
It's true that we might be inexperienced...

00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:39.860
...but...

00:15:39.860 --> 00:15:42.580
...as long as we work together, nothing is impossible!

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.210
Let's do it!

00:15:46.210 --> 00:15:47.840
Right!

00:15:58.780 --> 00:15:59.310
Marine!

00:16:01.440 --> 00:16:02.390
Sunshine!

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:09.400
Sunflower Aegis!

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:15.640
Now!

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:23.370
Nice teamwork!

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:26.840
They actually managed to predict his moves!

00:16:31.220 --> 00:16:35.890
We'll show you the strength of our hearts, pretty boy!{She consistently refers to him as "ikemen" where 'ikemen' is the HOT GUY denominator he's earned. It's hard to make her not sound like a flirtatious strumpet or clinically retarded.}

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:48.650
Gather, Floral Power!

00:16:50.300 --> 00:16:52.640
Shiny Tambourine!

00:17:06.720 --> 00:17:08.880
Flowers, dance for me!

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:13.890
Precure Gold Forte Burst!

00:17:20.480 --> 00:17:23.630
Gather, Dual Floral Power!

00:17:24.470 --> 00:17:29.760
Precure Floral Power Fortissimo!

00:17:37.450 --> 00:17:42.580
Precure Shining Fortissimo!

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:49.270
Heart Catch!

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:01.490
You've really grown.

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:06.600
Huh?

00:18:06.600 --> 00:18:07.560
Seriously?!

00:18:12.230 --> 00:18:13.850
Lord Coupe?!

00:18:13.850 --> 00:18:16.950
That mysterious hottie was 
Lord Coupe this whole time?!

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:23.370
Lord Coupe!

00:18:23.370 --> 00:18:25.360
I can't believe it was you, Lord Coupe.

00:18:25.360 --> 00:18:27.320
I totally didn't realize!

00:18:27.320 --> 00:18:29.330
Lord Coupe, you really are amazing!

00:18:29.640 --> 00:18:31.800
But why was he in that form?

00:18:31.800 --> 00:18:35.800
He wanted to be by Kaoruko's side in 
the form of the person she most loved.

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:39.410
I'm sure that was Lord Coupe's way of showing his affection.

00:18:40.280 --> 00:18:45.550
After all, a fairy wishes for nothing more than to give their partner strength.

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:56.570
I had a crush on him, and now my heart's been broken again!

00:18:56.930 --> 00:18:58.920
Come on, cheer up!

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:00.910
I'm sure you'll find someone!

00:19:04.070 --> 00:19:06.580
Potpourri, can you lend me that Seed again?

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:08.120
Shure!

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:12.540
Everyone, place your hands together.

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:14.000
Right.

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:15.460
You too, Yuri.

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:16.370
Huh?

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:36.360
The Seed changed shape!

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:42.280
It's proof that you have passed your trial.

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:48.960
Now place the Seed here.

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:49.750
Okay.

00:20:23.640 --> 00:20:28.250
Brave new Precures, you have
 done well to complete your trial.

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:31.020
Um, who are you?

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:34.460
It's the spirit of all the previous Precures speaking to you.

00:20:35.080 --> 00:20:36.670
Precures...

00:20:37.260 --> 00:20:39.960
Protect everything that lives in this world.

00:20:40.420 --> 00:20:44.290
Protect the Flowers within all their Hearts.

00:20:55.700 --> 00:20:58.040
This is the HeartCatch Mirage.

00:20:58.040 --> 00:21:00.320
We grant it to you.

00:21:00.960 --> 00:21:02.860
Thank you very much!

00:21:11.120 --> 00:21:13.800
Now we'll be able to become stronger, right?

00:21:13.800 --> 00:21:17.710
Maybe Yuri can become a Precure again!

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:18.920
Huh?

00:21:19.280 --> 00:21:23.660
When I heard the Mirage can make your potential grow to infinite levels, we did some thinking.

00:21:23.660 --> 00:21:28.090
If we obtained it, maybe you
 could become a Precure again!

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:31.860
Coupe...

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:35.610
Fifty years ago, it was just you and me.

00:21:36.320 --> 00:21:38.060
But things are different now.

00:21:38.430 --> 00:21:39.900
They'll be all right.

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:42.900
As long as they work together, I'm sure of it.

00:22:12.310 --> 00:22:17.980
So come on, let's sing together in harmony!

00:22:19.650 --> 00:22:22.190
Come on, all together now!

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:25.690
HeartCatch Precure!

00:22:27.070 --> 00:22:32.620
When you give life your all, within your heart

00:22:34.200 --> 00:22:38.210
a shining flower begins to bloom

00:22:40.210 --> 00:22:47.180
So when you feel like crying, raise your head

00:22:48.840 --> 00:22:53.890
and you'll see everyone's there by your side!

00:22:54.760 --> 00:22:59.970
So let's dance together, hand in hand!

00:23:02.650 --> 00:23:04.360
All those

00:23:04.520 --> 00:23:08.950
happy feelings will be shared amongst us!

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:14.200
Lose yourself is the melody!

00:23:14.190 --> 00:23:16.860
Yay, yay, hey!

00:23:17.410 --> 00:23:21.080
And tomorrow will bring even more Hallelujahs!

00:23:21.280 --> 00:23:27.210
So come on! Let's make the Flowers of our Hearts bloom!

00:23:28.830 --> 00:23:31.300
With all our might!

00:23:31.920 --> 00:23:34.590
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:35.590 --> 00:23:37.760
HeartCatch Precure!

00:23:42.690 --> 00:23:44.920
<i>An unbelievable miracle has happened!</i>

00:23:44.920 --> 00:23:47.320
<i>With passion and justice burning quietly in her heart... {silently -> quietly}</i>

00:23:47.320 --> 00:23:49.070
<i>...and an elegant and stylish outfit!</i>

00:23:49.070 --> 00:23:50.900
<i>Sleek, swaying long hair...</i>

00:23:50.900 --> 00:23:52.940
<i>...and a firm, gallant silhouette! {I love the usage of gallant here, if only because if this keeps getting used to describe her then I'm changing it to Goofus at some point.}</i>

00:23:52.940 --> 00:23:54.240
<i>It can only be her!</i>

00:23:54.240 --> 00:23:56.280
<i>A lone flower, sparkling in the Moon's light!</i>

00:23:56.280 --> 00:23:57.700
<i>Cure Moonlight!</i>

00:23:57.700 --> 00:24:00.120
